{#
  The whole site as one markdown file, for a model that would rather read once
  than crawl eight pages.

  Assembled from the collections, not from the rendered pages: `rawInput` is
  the original markdown with front matter stripped, so it round-trips exactly
  and no HTML-to-markdown conversion is involved anywhere in this build.

  `| safe` throughout — see the note in llms.txt.njk.
-#}
